 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Stop cleaning your shoes on those escalator brushes,",
   "s": 0.197,
   "e": 2.659
  },
  {
   "text": "because you're actually shoving your foot straight into the most dangerous spot on the whole machine.",
   "s": 3.005,
   "e": 7.663
  },
  {
   "text": "Almost everyone thinks they're a free shoe shine.",
   "s": 8.359,
   "e": 10.853
  },
  {
   "text": "In reality,",
   "s": 11.331,
   "e": 12.026
  },
  {
   "text": "they're a silent alarm.",
   "s": 12.288,
   "e": 13.51
  },
  {
   "text": "See,",
   "s": 14.109,
   "e": 14.399
  },
  {
   "text": "an escalator's metal steps are constantly moving,",
   "s": 14.54,
   "e": 17.231
  },
  {
   "text": "while the side wall next to them stays completely still.",
   "s": 17.678,
   "e": 20.53
  },
  {
   "text": "That leaves a razor-thin gap right along the edge,",
   "s": 21.154,
   "e": 23.973
  },
  {
   "text": "and if a shoelace,",
   "s": 24.322,
   "e": 25.238
  },
  {
   "text": "baggy pant leg,",
   "s": 25.536,
   "e": 26.471
  },
  {
   "text": "or soft sneaker slips in,",
   "s": 26.751,
   "e": 28.37
  },
  {
   "text": "the gears don't stop.",
   "s": 28.671,
   "e": 29.807
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why safety codes require skirt deflectors.",
   "s": 30.416,
   "e": 32.999
  },
  {
   "text": "The second those stiff bristles touch your ankle,",
   "s": 33.705,
   "e": 36.967
  },
  {
   "text": "your brain flinches and pulls your foot away.",
   "s": 37.11,
   "e": 38.752
  },
  {
   "text": "So,",
   "s": 39.268,
   "e": 39.57
  },
  {
   "text": "next time you go in for a free shine,",
   "s": 39.954,
   "e": 41.931
  },
  {
   "text": "remember.",
   "s": 42.194,
   "e": 42.711
  },
  {
   "text": "The escalator isn't cleaning your shoes.",
   "s": 43.089,
   "e": 45.221
  },
  {
   "text": "It's warning you to move.",
   "s": 45.585,
   "e": 46.866
  }
 ]
}